# My applications

Job applications built with [resume-me-agent](https://github.com/tobiasbrummer/resume-me-agent).

## Quick start

```sh
./bewerbung new <company>      # new application from applications/_template/
# edit applications/<company>/{meta.yaml,profil.md,anschreiben.md,…}
./bewerbung build <company>    # build PDF
```

Personal stammdaten live in `user.yaml`. Per-application data in
`applications/<company>/meta.yaml`.

See `AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS_FILE` for the full workflow (posting analysis,
optimization for ATS / LLM screening, self-test, build).

## Update the pipeline

```sh
docker pull ghcr.io/tobiasbrummer/resume-me-agent:latest
```
